<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>Appeals</li></ol><p class="kick">Appeals</p><h1>What we are raising money for</h1><p class="lede">Each appeal has a target and a list of what gifts pay for. Progress bars are drawn on the server from the amounts raised. Gifts are made by check, bank transfer or in person; see ways to give.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight" style="padding-bottom:70px"><div class="w"><div class="g2" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))">{% for a in Target.Items %}{%- assign y=a.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture ast -%}{{ y.status }}{%- endcapture -%}<div class="panel light"><p class="kick">{% capture lv13 -%}{{ y.status }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv13 %}{% when "open" %}Open{% when "met" %}Target met{% when "closed" %}Closed{% else %}{{ lv13 }}{% endcase %} · {{ y.closes }}</p><h3><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ a.RoutePath }}" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:none">{{ a.PrimaryField }}</a></h3><p class="muted" style="margin:0">{{ y.summary }}</p>{%- assign gl = y.goal | append: "" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign rs = y.raised | append: "" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign gp = rs | times: 100 | divided_by: gl | floor -%}{% if gp > 100 %}{%- assign gp = 100 -%}{% endif %}{%- assign left = gl | minus: rs -%}<div class="gauge"><div class="track" role="img" aria-label="{{ gp }} percent of target raised"><i style="width:{{ gp }}%"></i></div><div class="nums"><span><b>${{ rs | format_number: "N0" }}</b>raised</span><span style="text-align:center"><b>{{ gp }}%</b>of target</span><span style="text-align:right"><b>${{ gl | format_number: "N0" }}</b>target</span></div></div><p class="muted" style="font-size:.88rem;margin:0">{{ y.donors }} donors</p></div>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
